LCRD — LIMN Camera Reference Database

This repository uses a purpose-based licensing structure. Do not treat every
file as dual-licensed. An individual file with an explicit, different
pre-existing license retains that license.

Database and data
-----------------
Original LCRD database contents and generated data distributions in `data/`
and `dist/` are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license (CC BY 4.0), to the extent LIMNMEDIA LLC and
contributors have rights to license them. This includes the database content,
not the software used to build it.

Software and tooling
--------------------
Original LCRD software and operating infrastructure in `tools/`, `tests/`,
`schema/`, `.github/workflows/`, and scripts or build/validation automation are
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (Apache-2.0). JSON Schema files are
software/interface infrastructure for this purpose.

Documentation
-------------
Original LCRD documentation and other prose, including `docs/`, `README.md`,
`CONTRIBUTING.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and original documentation outside those
paths, are licensed under CC BY 4.0 unless a file states otherwise or contains
third-party material requiring different treatment.

Repository-wide fallback
-------------------------
When a file does not fit one of the listed paths, classify it by purpose:
original LCRD data, database content, and documentation are CC BY 4.0;
original LCRD software, schemas, tests, automation, and executable/build
infrastructure are Apache-2.0. Do not apply Apache-2.0 to the LCRD database,
or CC BY 4.0 to software infrastructure merely because it is in the same
repository.

Research and third-party material
---------------------------------
`Research/` is preserved source and historical research material and is not
blanket-licensed by this notice. Original LCRD-authored research notes,
factual observations, source records, URLs, citations, hashes, and research
data may be covered by the applicable LCRD license where LIMNMEDIA LLC or
contributors have the rights to license them. Third-party specifications,
documents, copied text, externally authored datasets, photographs, RAW/JPEG
samples, sample media, trademarks, logos, product names, and other externally
authored works retain their original rights/status and are not relicensed
merely because LCRD stores or references them. See `Research/LICENSING.md`.

Complete license texts are available in:

- `LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt`
- `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`

Recommended attribution for LCRD data:

> LCRD — LIMN Camera Reference Database, LIMNMEDIA LLC, licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Attribution may be provided in a reasonable location appropriate to the
consuming work, consistent with CC BY 4.0.
